{"unit_id":"NEETnina__dsh-model-master#card-zh","repo":"NEETnina/dsh-model-master","commit":"28b010e5fbce008e8634401909299c74634d0237","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-master（模型选择大师）是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型选择插件。它接管原生模型列表的狭小弹出界面，提供 Spotlight 式面板，并保留原生按钮与菜单。用户可以搜索模型、按渠道浏览、选择模型、查看智能优选结果、发起流式测速并查看全球模型榜单；还可切换界面语言与主题。测速在 DSH 的 LLM 服务端运行时完成，结果保存在本机；榜单和版本信息从公开服务读取。适合需要在多个提供商和模型间查找、比较和切换的 DSH Web 用户。需要 DSH 0.2.x 与 Node.js 20 或更高版本，不需要为插件另配 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1030-1103","client.js:3885-4120"]}
{"unit_id":"NEETnina__dsh-model-master#card-en","repo":"NEETnina/dsh-model-master","commit":"28b010e5fbce008e8634401909299c74634d0237","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-master is a searchable model picker for DSH Web. Browse providers, switch models, run streaming speed probes, and compare a global leaderboard. It supports multiple languages and themes. Probes use DSH's LLM runtime and save results locally. Requires DSH 0.2.x and Node.js 20+.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1030-1103","client.js:3885-4120"]}
