{"unit_id":"NEETnina__dsh-model-master#feature-search","repo":"NEETnina/dsh-model-master","commit":"28b010e5fbce008e8634401909299c74634d0237","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-master 的功能「搜索与切换模型」：把 DSH 原生的模型列表入口接到 Spotlight 面板，可搜索模型并按提供商分组浏览；点选模型后通过 DSH 的目录服务应用选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:3885-4120","client.js:5478-5605"]}
{"unit_id":"NEETnina__dsh-model-master#feature-probe","repo":"NEETnina/dsh-model-master","commit":"28b010e5fbce008e8634401909299c74634d0237","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-master 的功能「流式测速」：在模型行触发单模型探针，服务端经 DSH LLM runtime 发起请求并记录 TTFT、TPS 和评分；支持多样本中位数汇总。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:741-1029","client.js:5731-5785"]}
{"unit_id":"NEETnina__dsh-model-master#feature-batch","repo":"NEETnina/dsh-model-master","commit":"28b010e5fbce008e8634401909299c74634d0237","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-master 的功能「批量测速」：工具栏启动后逐个安排目标模型，最多两个并发执行，可取消队列；结束时汇报成功和失败数量。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:5787-5850"]}
{"unit_id":"NEETnina__dsh-model-master#feature-leaderboard","repo":"NEETnina/dsh-model-master","commit":"28b010e5fbce008e8634401909299c74634d0237","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-master 的功能「全球模型榜单」：展示 OpenRouter 目录中带公开基准分数的模型，最多 100 条；每日同步或手动刷新，点击榜单行可跳到本地模型搜索。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:156-264","client.js:3885-4120"]}
{"unit_id":"NEETnina__dsh-model-master#feature-storage","repo":"NEETnina/dsh-model-master","commit":"28b010e5fbce008e8634401909299c74634d0237","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-master 的功能「保存测速记录」：将服务端产生的测速结果保存在 DSH 数据目录中，面板可以读取记录、删除单条或清空全部结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:701-739","index.js:1206-1228"]}
